      "writtenOn": "2015-04-10T15:44:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PropertiesComponent writes to the workspace file, that most people don\u0027t put under version control. According to the email thread with Dmitry, IJ would have a UI for editing this list, so I though it needs a proper configuration file.",
